THAC0: +4
Damage: 2d4+5, +1 fire damage, +1 cold damage, +1 acid damage, +1 poison damage
Damage type: Crushing
Speed Factor: 3
Proficiency Type: Flail/Morning Star
Type: One-handed
Requires:
 13 Strength

Weight: 9"






